      "content": "hey so i was working in the garden and accidentally stepped on an old rusty trowel. its a pretty deep puncture in my foot. its bleeding a bit but i dont really have time to go to the doctor right now cuz i gotta finish this project. how can i just clean it out and seal it up so it doesnt get infected? any good ways to do that at home?",
