      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tips. i'm a bit worried about the hydrogen peroxide thing though, my friend said it might make it heal slower. and the wound is still gaping a bit, i don't think a regular bandaid will hold it closed. would it be okay to just use some superglue to seal the edges shut once i've cleaned it? that seems like it would keep all the dirt out better.",
