      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i'm just really stressed about the infection part since the tool was so rusty and old. if i can't use superglue, what's the absolute best thing i can put in there to make sure it's dead and won't get infected? like, is there a strong home remedy or a specific combo of things i can use to make sure the bacteria is totally gone? i really don't want to go to the clinic if i can help it.",
